msgid "Binary Search Trees"
msgstr "二叉搜索树"

msgid "In this chapter, we discuss a new data structure: binary search trees. Binary search Trees (BSTs) are known to allow for faster operations on searching and inserting."
msgstr "在本章中，我们讨论一种新的数据结构：二叉搜索树。二叉搜索树（BST）能够更快地完成查找和插入操作。"

